---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_NAMES } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
const title = `Cookies – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`;
const description = GA4_ID ? 'Google Analytics audience measurement cookies and nothing else: names, purpose, a lifetime of 13 months at most, the provider and how to object.' : 'The site sets no cookies: what you type stays in your browser and nothing is kept on your device.';
---
{/* Page générée par scripts/gen-legal-pages.py (trame, décision GA4 du 2026-10-17). Ne pas
     retoucher à la main : relancer le script. Un passage propre au site se garde entre
     les marqueurs site:debut et site:fin. */}
<PageLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookies</h1>
    {GA4_ID ? (<>
    <p>The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies and those alone: no advertising cookie, no social media cookie. Details of the processing are in the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>Cookies set</h2>
    <table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Provider</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Lifetime</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><td><code>_ga</code></td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Tell visitors apart with a random identifier</td><td>13 months at most (390 days)</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code></td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Keep the state of the current visit</td><td>13 months at most (390 days)</td></tr>
    </tbody></table>
    <p>These lifetimes are not extended on each visit; Google’s default is 2 years and the site shortens it. Purpose: audience measurement (pages viewed, referrer, device, approximate country). The IP address is anonymised: Google Analytics 4 neither logs nor stores it. No advertising and no ad sharing: ad storage, ad personalisation and Google signals are switched off.</p>
    <p>Provider: Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland. Data may be transferred to Google LLC in the United States under the EU–U.S. Data Privacy Framework and the European Commission’s standard contractual clauses. Retention at Google: 14 months. Legal basis: the publisher’s legitimate interests (Article 6(1)(f) GDPR; in New Zealand, Information Privacy Principle 1 of the Privacy Act 2020, collection for a lawful purpose connected with our activities).</p>
    <h2>Objecting to these cookies</h2>
    <p>Block or delete cookies in your browser settings, or install the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>. The site and its calculators work the same way.</p>
    </>) : (<>
    <p>The site <strong>sets no cookies</strong>. Details of the processing are in the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>
    </>)}
    {CLARITY_ID && (<><h2>Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free</h2><p>Page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity in cookie-free mode: Clarity sets no cookies, each page view gets a single-use identifier, and page content and your inputs are masked. Blocking <code>clarity.ms</code> stops it.</p></>)}
    <h2>What you type</h2>
    <p>Calculations run in your browser: what you enter is sent to no server and is gone when you close the page.</p>
    <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
